{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_107_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_107","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，楚子伐麇。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_107_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_107","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔彭生會晉郤缺於承匡。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_107_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_107","textTraditional":"三、秋，曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_107_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_107","textTraditional":"四、公子遂如宋。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_107_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_107","textTraditional":"五、狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_107_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_107","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，甲午，叔孫得臣敗狄於鹹。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_107_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_107","textTraditional":"不言帥師而言敗，何也？直敗，一人之辭也。一人而曰敗何也？以眾焉言之也。傳曰，長狄也，弟兄三人，佚害中國，瓦石不能害。叔孫得臣，最善射者也。射其目，身橫九畝。斷其首，眉見於軾。然則何為不言獲也？曰，古者，不重創，不擒二毛，故不言獲，為內諱也。其之齊者，王子成父殺之。則未知其之晉者也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}